Infrastructure cost to rebuild everything is massive


Mint-to Logic™ can fix the limitations without disruption


It can wrap around existing chains (Ethereum, Solana, etc.) via plugin or smart contract API


Offers instant ethical intelligence upgrade without forcing entire economies to shift platforms


Mint-to Logic™ doesn’t break the blockchain.
